# SQL: Breaking Games Database

This folder contains the SQLite database I built during the Breaking Games externship, plus the queries I ran against it.

## Files

| File | What it is |
|---|---|
| `breaking_games.db` | SQLite database: the 6 raw exports plus 3 tables I designed and built |
| `breaking_games.sqbpro` | DB Browser project file that opens the database with all my query tabs |
| `all_queries.sql` | Every query from the externship in one file, organized by project |

## How to Open
1. Install [DB Browser for SQLite](https://sqlitebrowser.org/)
2. Open `breaking_games.sqbpro` (or `breaking_games.db` directly)
3. Browse tables in **Browse Data**, or run queries in **Execute SQL** (Ctrl+Enter)
